# The build context is the repository root. Send only what the image builds:
# the proxy's Go sources, the app and, for the rocks target, the website and the
# docs Astro reads. Drop secrets, host build artifacts and the docs the Astro
# build never reads (legal source texts, plans).
*
!reverse-proxy/go.mod
!reverse-proxy/go.sum
!reverse-proxy/*.go
reverse-proxy/*_test.go
!frontend
!website
!docs
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
website/.astro
docs/rechtsquellen
docs/plans
